{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n《璀璨之城》劇情愈來愈激！昨晚張智霖飾演的孝賢徹底成魔，目露凶光將高海寧推落床兼威脅，恐怖演技嚇到網民話「真實得不像演出來」。不過，絕密花絮卻揭露他鏡頭後完全是另一個人，一個驚人舉動更令全場爆笑，究竟發生咩事？\n</p>\n<h2>張智霖成魔目露凶光 高海寧嚇到額頭爆青筋</h2>\n<p>在昨晚的劇情中，得勢後的孝賢（張智霖飾）將君臨舫送給Alice（高海寧飾），並冷冷地表示信奉「Sharing is caring」，暗示將有更多「厚禮」。這份美意背後卻暗藏殺機，他質問Alice：「我係咪你最信得過（嘅人）？定你覺得我畀個陷阱你踩？」當Alice企圖推卻時，孝賢即怒喝：「你嫁入嚟就係為咗呢啲嘢架啦，同我簽咗佢！」之後更失控將Alice一把推落床，目露凶光地掐住她的頸威脅：「我同你講，我娶你返嚟就係用你，我鍾意點用就點用，就算擺到明我挖個窿，你都要同我跳落去，清楚未？」張智霖的壓逼感演技真實度極高，嚇得高海寧眼球亂轉、額頭青筋盡現，畫面張力十足。</p>\n<h2>花絮揭驚人反差 張智霖「蠄蟝彈」上床勁紳士</h2>\n<p>雖然戲內是恐怖魔王，但鏡頭後的張智霖卻是另一副模樣。根據TVB發放的絕密花絮片段，排練這場張力爆燈的戲時，張智霖不但毫無兇惡之氣，反而散發著可愛感，頻頻令高海寧笑場。在排練撲上床一幕時，為了盡量避免身體接觸，張智霖竟展現驚人腹肌，以一招「蠄蟝彈」的姿勢跳上床，動作滑稽又體貼，引得現場所有工作人員捧腹大笑，亦充分展現了他真實一面的紳士風度，與劇中成魔的孝賢形成強烈對比。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版激讚：真實到不像演出來！</h2>\n<p>孝賢的黑化演出在網上引起洗版式討論，網民對張智霖的恐怖演技大感佩服，認為他演活了變態角色。「難怪張智霖說，在片場時，女演員們都有點懼怕他。」「想不到他演變態會這麼像，毫無違和感。」「真實到不像演出來。」而孝賢昨晚一句冷冰冰的「Sharing is Caring」，更獲網民洗版式讚好，封為年度金句！「睇花絮先知原來佢為咗唔掂到高Ling用腹肌跳上床，戲內係魔鬼，戲外係紳士，太圈粉了！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_7779561146ae42ea583091.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_7779561146ae42ea583091.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_21402993006ae42ea89d43a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_21402993006ae42ea89d43a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_19139341916ae42eaec4dee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_19139341916ae42eaec4dee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_12597407506ae42eb6b0dd2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_12597407506ae42eb6b0dd2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_17491555696ae42ebc99aa4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_17491555696ae42ebc99aa4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_5085901766ae42ec6e1eab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_5085901766ae42ec6e1eab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_15410108836ae42ec8f37b9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_15410108836ae42ec8f37b9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17a_12558466786ae42ecbb0388.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17a_12558466786ae42ecbb0388.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_14667123966ae42ece39e32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_14667123966ae42ece39e32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_397303976ae42ed0cc8f3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_397303976ae42ed0cc8f3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_328477576ae42ed2f038d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_328477576ae42ed2f038d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:31:32.782995+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1164,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:06:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:33.322880+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:21:42.485677+00:00","content_hash":"10311562c143f240c956d3efe8e2c2eb5371af4ce8c8899fb0a93dddb25f7988","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}